            'category' => 'architecture',
            'duration_seconds' => 180,
            'note' => 'ClientHello speculatively sends Diffie-Hellman key share in first packet (1-RTT); ServerHello responds with key share and switches to encrypted traffic immediately. Mandates Ephemeral Diffie-Hellman (PFS), mandates AEAD ciphers (AES-GCM / ChaCha20-Poly1305), and bans static RSA key exchange.',
