            'category' => 'technical',
            'duration_seconds' => 180,
            'note' => 'PFS generates unique ephemeral key pairs discarded after every session. Even if an attacker records encrypted traffic for 10 years and later steals the server\'s long-term private key, they cannot decrypt historical sessions because ephemeral keys no longer exist.',
